{"vid":"fIqKfIgSqCc","source":"fIqKfIgSqCc.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"🎵Music🎵"},{"t":10.6,"txt":"Here's a career that comes with a lot of pressure."},{"t":13.6,"txt":"And the goal is to keep all that pressure inside."},{"t":17.2,"txt":"Inside a boiler, that is."},{"t":19.5,"txt":"If you can handle physical work,"},{"t":21.5,"txt":"have good metalworking skills,"},{"t":23.4,"txt":"and can keep your cool working in challenging places,"},{"t":26.5,"txt":"you just might have what it takes to be a boilermaker."},{"t":30.2,"txt":"Boilermakers build, repair, and maintain"},{"t":33.4,"txt":"boilers, tanks, and other pressure containers."},{"t":36.3,"txt":"Some of these containers are made to hold steam"},{"t":39,"txt":"for power and heat"},{"t":40.4,"txt":"while others hold air, liquids, and gases used for other processes."},{"t":45.2,"txt":"Boilermakers do important work on these containers"},{"t":47.9,"txt":"to make sure they last for many years."},{"t":50.2,"txt":"To get an accurate reading on this high pressure career"},{"t":53.6,"txt":"we talked to a boilermaker here in Alberta."},{"t":56.8,"txt":"🎵Music🎵"},{"t":61,"txt":"Hi, my name is Bren and I am a boilermaker."},{"t":65.5,"txt":"Boilermakers build and maintain various pressure vessels."},{"t":69.5,"txt":"We use different methods, working with metals to"},{"t":71.7,"txt":"maintain and repair these structures."},{"t":74.1,"txt":"Some vessels that we work on could include"},{"t":77.4,"txt":"towers, tanks, and boilers."},{"t":80.1,"txt":"What I really enjoy about my job is every day is different."},{"t":83.9,"txt":"There's a lot of variety in boilermaking."},{"t":85.7,"txt":"One day you can be inside the vessel and installing components"},{"t":89.8,"txt":"and another day you can be doing the rigging."},{"t":94.7,"txt":"First thing in the morning, we have our toolbox talk,"},{"t":97.2,"txt":"which sets us up for the day,"},{"t":98.5,"txt":"and then we go and put on our PPE [personal protective equipment],"},{"t":100.6,"txt":"which consists of our coveralls and work boots"},{"t":103.5,"txt":"and hard hat and gloves and safety glasses."},{"t":106,"txt":"And then we go out onto the field"},{"t":108.8,"txt":"and start performing our duties for work,"},{"t":111.3,"txt":"whether that be grinding or welding."},{"t":114,"txt":"You could be working on exchangers"},{"t":116,"txt":"one day and then the next day you've been put on another crew"},{"t":119.2,"txt":"laying out components."},{"t":121.2,"txt":"You can work anywhere from refineries to shipyards, pulp mills"},{"t":125.5,"txt":"to nuclear power plants."},{"t":127.6,"txt":"No place is the same."},{"t":129.3,"txt":"As a boilermaker, some of my duties can include:"},{"t":131.7,"txt":"plan the sequence of work that we're going to be doing for the day"},{"t":134.4,"txt":"which could entail us laying out and cutting metal"},{"t":138.2,"txt":"using hot or cold methods."},{"t":140.2,"txt":"A hot method could be oxy fuel cutting"},{"t":142.6,"txt":"and cold methods could be using a Zipcut."},{"t":145,"txt":"We also fit and assemble components using fastening methods."},{"t":151.2,"txt":"Boiler house rigging"},{"t":152.8,"txt":"is something that we do that is very common, where we set up"},{"t":156.3,"txt":"comealongs and rigging"},{"t":158.5,"txt":"and we hoist and lift pieces in and out of the boiler."},{"t":165.4,"txt":"It helps to be strong and to be physically fit."},{"t":168.2,"txt":"We do do a lot of heavy lifting."},{"t":170.7,"txt":"It's also good to have problem solving skills and the ability to work"},{"t":174.8,"txt":"in a team setting."},{"t":175.8,"txt":"You should enjoy working with tools, equipment, and machinery."},{"t":179.7,"txt":"It's very important that"},{"t":181.1,"txt":"you're able to work in confined spaces and at heights."},{"t":183.9,"txt":"Working on top of a boiler"},{"t":185.7,"txt":"could be upwards of 200 feet in the air."},{"t":188.1,"txt":"It's also good to be flexible about working in shifts"},{"t":191.1,"txt":"and the ability to be able to travel."},{"t":194.4,"txt":"When you're on site, it's usually very noisy."},{"t":197.7,"txt":"There's always background noise, whether it be"},{"t":200.5,"txt":"heavy hauler trucks driving by"},{"t":202.7,"txt":"or somebody's grinding."},{"t":204.9,"txt":"We work in a variety of places which could include indoors in a shop"},{"t":210,"txt":"or outdoors in the middle of winter, so we're all-season workers."},{"t":214.2,"txt":"To work as a boilermaker in Alberta"},{"t":216.5,"txt":"either you must be a registered apprentice or a certified journeyperson."},{"t":220.7,"txt":"Or you can also be someone that holds a recognized trade certificate."},{"t":225.2,"txt":"The apprenticeship is three years long"},{"t":227.2,"txt":"and at the end of your three years you can take an exam"},{"t":230.6,"txt":"to get your Red Seal."},{"t":231.9,"txt":"Experienced boilermakers may also"},{"t":234.3,"txt":"advance to supervisory positions or"},{"t":237.3,"txt":"can get into quality control and assurance."},{"t":241.8,"txt":"Becoming a boilermaker has allowed me to"},{"t":244.9,"txt":"further my education in the metal trades"},{"t":247.9,"txt":"and gone on to becoming quality control."},{"t":251.4,"txt":"Some of the benefits of this career"},{"t":253.2,"txt":"is that work is always changing, it pays really well,"},{"t":256.6,"txt":"it's really dynamic, and it's exciting."},{"t":261.1,"txt":"Boilermaking has been the best thing that I've ever done"},{"t":264.8,"txt":"and I highly recommend it."},{"t":268.1,"txt":"To be successful at this job"},{"t":270.2,"txt":"you need to be physically strong and"},{"t":272,"txt":"have good hand-eye coordination."},{"t":274.3,"txt":"You should be able to work at heights and in tight spaces."},{"t":278.2,"txt":"If you can handle long shifts using heavy parts and machinery"},{"t":282.1,"txt":"and you're a good \"steam\" player,"},{"t":284.4,"txt":"you've got the right stuff to weld yourself a solid career"},{"t":288,"txt":"as a boilermaker."},{"t":289.3,"txt":"If you want to get a solid look at this occupation"},{"t":292.4,"txt":"including training requirements and salary ranges,"},{"t":295.5,"txt":"go to the occupational profile on the alis website."},{"t":299.1,"txt":"While you're there, check out related occupations"},{"t":302.1,"txt":"including metal fabricator (fitter),"},{"t":304,"txt":"non-destructive testing technician,"},{"t":306.4,"txt":"and ironworker."},{"t":308.8,"txt":"Explore the possibilities."},{"t":310.9,"txt":"Go to alis.alberta.ca"},{"t":314.3,"txt":"🎵Music🎵"}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"🎵Music🎵"},{"t":10.56,"w":"Here's"},{"t":10.56,"w":"a"},{"t":10.56,"w":"career"},{"t":10.56,"w":"that"},{"t":10.56,"w":"comes"},{"t":10.56,"w":"with"},{"t":10.56,"w":"a"},{"t":10.56,"w":"lot"},{"t":10.56,"w":"of"},{"t":10.56,"w":"pressure."},{"t":13.599,"w":"And"},{"t":13.599,"w":"the"},{"t":13.599,"w":"goal"},{"t":13.599,"w":"is"},{"t":13.599,"w":"to"},{"t":13.599,"w":"keep"},{"t":13.599,"w":"all"},{"t":13.599,"w":"that"},{"t":13.599,"w":"pressure"},{"t":13.599,"w":"inside."},{"t":17.2,"w":"Inside"},{"t":17.2,"w":"a"},{"t":17.2,"w":"boiler,"},{"t":17.2,"w":"that"},{"t":17.2,"w":"is."},{"t":19.483,"w":"If"},{"t":19.483,"w":"you"},{"t":19.483,"w":"can"},{"t":19.483,"w":"handle"},{"t":19.483,"w":"physical"},{"t":19.483,"w":"work,"},{"t":21.488,"w":"have"},{"t":21.488,"w":"good"},{"t":21.488,"w":"metalworking"},{"t":21.488,"w":"skills,"},{"t":23.355,"w":"and"},{"t":23.355,"w":"can"},{"t":23.355,"w":"keep"},{"t":23.355,"w":"your"},{"t":23.355,"w":"cool"},{"t":23.355,"w":"working"},{"t":23.355,"w":"in"},{"t":23.355,"w":"challenging"},{"t":23.355,"w":"places,"},{"t":26.536,"w":"you"},{"t":26.536,"w":"just"},{"t":26.536,"w":"might"},{"t":26.536,"w":"have"},{"t":26.536,"w":"what"},{"t":26.536,"w":"it"},{"t":26.536,"w":"takes"},{"t":26.536,"w":"to"},{"t":26.536,"w":"be"},{"t":26.536,"w":"a"},{"t":26.536,"w":"boilermaker."},{"t":30.209,"w":"Boilermakers"},{"t":30.209,"w":"build,"}